    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d315-a1">

                <pb facs="0382" n="332" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg332"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 129.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Muñoz to Mr. Young.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of
                            Foreign Relations of the Republic of Guatemala, Central America</hi>, <lb/>
                        <placeName><placeName type="venue"><hi rendition="#italic">National
                                    Palace</hi></placeName>, <placeName type="city"><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Guatemala</hi></placeName></placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1894-10-03"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October 3, 1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have had the pleasure to receive your excellency’s polite note of the 24th
                    ultimo, informing me that the minister of China at Washington has requested the
                    U. S. Government to allow its diplomatic representative in Guatemala to use his
                    good offices in behalf of Chinese residents here, with which request your
                    excellency’s Government is disposed to comply, provided that such a step meets
                    the approval of the Government of Guatemala.</p>
                <p>In reply I have the honor to inform your excellency, having been authorized to do
                    so by the President of the Republic, that my Government will have no objection
                    to giving its approval in this case, provided the Chinese Government addresses
                    to it the request to that end, which seems natural.</p>
                <p>I reiterate, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jorge Muñoz.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
